 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Once upon a twilight when the stars came out at lunchtime and the acorns glowed, there lived a brave little wood biter named Lola. Lola loved to explore the woods behind her house, and one night she heard a small sound. She followed it and found a tiny door in the tree root. Lola didn't know, but she was brave, so she opened the door and went in. It was dark, but she had a small torch. Maybe start at the big tree in the garden and skip the door bit. So, Lola followed the sound and found a small room. Sure, go ahead.",
